WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Ask an intelligence-settings manager to check the selected company’s saved key, enablement, budget and request cap.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Check the provider account has API billing and access to the configured model.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Review the error and keep your source or editor draft. Use ordinary manual editing if generation is unavailable.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: For an uncertain failed request, investigate before starting another request, since estimated usage may already be reserved.
